<title>USA: A.M. Castle unit to buy plastics company.</title>
<headline>A.M. Castle unit to buy plastics company.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN PARK, Ill. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Plastics Inc, a subsidiary of A.M. Castle &amp; Co, said Wednesday it is acquiring  ASN Plastics of Indianapolis, Ind. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is consistent with Total Plastics' plan to be one of the Midwest's largest distributors and fabricators of industrial products.</p>
<p>Total Plastics provides products and services to the automotive, medical, electronic, marine and display sectors. Its parent, A.M. Castle, is an industrial distributor of highly engineered metals.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
